TITLE:: RCOrgnsmRegistry
summary:: Registry of a song's orgnsms and fobjects
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCSong, Classes/RCOrgnsm, Classes/RCFObject

DESCRIPTION::
code::orgnsms:: is species → tribe → number → link::Classes/RCOrgnsm::. Numbers are allocated per (species, tribe) and never reused within a song; registering a fixed number that already exists picks the next free one instead of overwriting. Fobjects are registered by name, with a numeric suffix when the name is taken.

INSTANCEMETHODS::
METHOD:: register
argument:: orgnsm
argument:: pickNewNumber
METHOD:: remove
METHOD:: tribe
argument:: species
argument:: tribe
METHOD:: all
METHOD:: size
METHOD:: fobjects
METHOD:: fobject
argument:: name
METHOD:: addFobject
METHOD:: removeFobject
METHOD:: clear
